  "note": "The Lunenburg High School roster continued from page 44, same layout: column 1 name at col 17 / role at col 47, column 2 name at col 75 / role at col 106. Lines 1, 3, 12, 15, 18 and 22 each carry a section heading in one column beside a person in the other ('Unified Arts', 'Foreign Language', 'Media Specialist', 'Guidance', 'Tutors/Aides', 'Cafeteria'); because every line may be listed once they are filed under entries, and those headings still govern the grade_or_dept of the entries below them in their own column. Joanne McQuaid on line 1 sits under a heading that was on page 44, so her grade_or_dept is empty. 'Tutors/Aides' and 'Media Specialist' are headings that name a role rather than a department, so they appear in both fields for the people beneath them."
